    "text": "By Virtue of powers vested in me by Section 3 of the Mediation (Special Categories of Disputes) Act, No. 21 of 2003, I,Wijeyadasa Rajapakshe, Minister of Justice and Labour Relations, do by this Order, specify that the monetary value of thesubject matter within the Special Mediation Boards Area specified by order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1904/41dated 04.03.2015 shall be less than Rs. 2,000,000 in respect of a dispute of the category of disputes determined by orderpublsihed in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 1901/8 dated 10.02.2015 arising wholly or partly within such area.",
